  "APIProfile": "Basic",
  "Description": "Understands a text. One SubAIM, Natural Language Understanding. The UA writes a Basic Text Object (or Text Object) to InputText OR RecognisedText - either may be absent - and the Controller routes it to NLU; the Text Descriptors, Refined Text, and Text Personal Status come back. Text ports accept OSD-BTO and OSD-TXO. The two text inputs are told apart by PortNumber (1 = Input Text, 2 = Recognised Text) on the AIM Input side, and both are optional, mirroring the proven UAG-IDR pattern.",
